WEBVTT

00:00:01.440 --> 00:00:04.590
5000 years ago, Earthbound Immortals 
were sealed inside geoglyphs.

00:00:04.590 --> 00:00:06.420
And 5000 years before that, there was

00:00:06.840 --> 00:00:10.130
an Earthbound Immortal that pushed 
Crimson Dragon to its limits.

00:00:10.130 --> 00:00:13.100
It was sealed deeper than the geoglyphs.

00:00:13.280 --> 00:00:16.820
That Earthbound Immortal was Red Nova!

00:00:24.950 --> 00:00:25.980
What's this?

00:00:44.710 --> 00:00:48.250
The rare Earthbound Immortal Red Nova…

00:00:50.060 --> 00:00:51.580
It's the Crimson Devil.

00:00:52.660 --> 00:00:56.560
I have no desire to offer you my body!

00:00:56.880 --> 00:00:58.450
My turn!

00:00:59.730 --> 00:01:02.690
I summon Dark Resonator!

00:01:04.560 --> 00:01:05.960
It's a Tuner Monster!

00:01:06.140 --> 00:01:09.150
Jack, you're going to keep using more power?

00:01:09.290 --> 00:01:14.030
Level 3 Dark Resonator tunes 
Level 5 Big Piece Golem!

00:01:16.750 --> 00:01:19.500
The pulse of the King now forms a line here!

00:01:19.810 --> 00:01:22.180
Witness the power of the rumbling heavens!

00:01:22.750 --> 00:01:23.900
Synchro Summon!

00:01:24.340 --> 00:01:27.920
My soul!  Red Dragon Archfiend!

00:01:31.110 --> 00:01:33.250
It's here!

00:01:33.250 --> 00:01:36.310
Your ace monster symbolizes you!

00:01:36.480 --> 00:01:39.440
Red Dragon Archfiend attacks you directly!

00:01:39.600 --> 00:01:41.750
No matter what, you want to win 
by solely relying on power?

00:01:42.150 --> 00:01:44.250
Absolute Powerforce!

00:01:46.620 --> 00:01:49.760
Your spirit is incredible 
because it never gives up!

00:01:49.760 --> 00:01:53.950
But due to the effect of Abyss 
Boat Watchman in my graveyard,

00:01:53.950 --> 00:01:58.430
I can Special Summon one Abyss 
monster when your monster attacks!

00:01:58.430 --> 00:02:00.590
Come, Abyss Guardian!

00:02:04.560 --> 00:02:09.690
Then due to the effect of Abyss Kid in my 
graveyard, a monster on my field is destroyed.

00:02:10.080 --> 00:02:16.890
When Abyss Guardian is destroyed, the Battle 
Phase ends, and you take 800 points of damage!

00:02:21.750 --> 00:02:22.650
I end my turn!

00:02:22.830 --> 00:02:26.040
Resurrect a monster from 
the graveyard, destroy it,

00:02:26.040 --> 00:02:29.460
force the battle to end and 
deal damage to the opponent.

00:02:29.460 --> 00:02:31.470
It's a perfect defense combo.

00:02:31.630 --> 00:02:33.430
Jack has 800 life points.

00:02:33.430 --> 00:02:36.030
If Jack attacks as usual on the next turn,

00:02:36.030 --> 00:02:38.630
the combo will activate, and 
his life points will become 0.

00:02:39.080 --> 00:02:40.100
Jack…

00:02:46.810 --> 00:02:48.250
Riding Duels.

00:02:48.460 --> 00:02:51.400
These duels evolved in the world of speed.

00:02:51.640 --> 00:02:58.310
The people with the legendary marks who 
risked their lives were known as 5D's.

00:03:13.370 --> 00:03:19.540
Reach out your hand and 
grab a bright tomorrow

00:03:19.780 --> 00:03:29.650
Soar in the infinite skies  BELIEVE IN NEXUS

00:03:30.290 --> 00:03:35.890
No one can stop my wild impulses

00:03:36.260 --> 00:03:41.870
My hand sweats as the battle 
intensifies  This Heart Beat

00:03:42.400 --> 00:03:47.640
I can't avoid this fearsome battle

00:03:47.870 --> 00:03:53.240
I don't want it to end here  Go For It!!

00:03:54.350 --> 00:03:59.620
Stand up  Don't tremble in fear alone

00:03:59.780 --> 00:04:05.420
Remember that you have 
friends waiting for you

00:04:05.660 --> 00:04:11.730
I'm not scared and I'll never give 
up, no matter how powerful the enemy

00:04:11.730 --> 00:04:18.040
With real courage, I'll never lose

00:04:42.160 --> 00:04:47.830
Burning Soul!Red Nova Dragon

00:04:52.700 --> 00:04:54.360
My turn.

00:04:55.100 --> 00:04:57.920
I'll just end my turn.

00:04:58.130 --> 00:04:59.870
There's nothing for me to do.

00:05:00.720 --> 00:05:02.180
My turn!

00:05:07.970 --> 00:05:11.250
Red Dragon Archfiend attacks you directly!

00:05:11.640 --> 00:05:14.890
Why, Jack?  He has a combo ready!

00:05:14.890 --> 00:05:15.590
Jack!

00:05:15.590 --> 00:05:18.330
Absolute Powerforce!

00:05:18.550 --> 00:05:22.200
Interesting.  I'll stay with you to the end.

00:05:22.200 --> 00:05:26.370
When your monster attacks, due to 
the effect of Abyss Boat Watchman

00:05:26.370 --> 00:05:29.870
in my graveyard, I Special Summon 
Abyss Guardian to my field!

00:05:33.570 --> 00:05:37.290
When a monster is Special Summoned 
during the Battle Phase,

00:05:37.420 --> 00:05:41.280
I can Special Summon Extra 
Veiler from my hand.

00:05:47.620 --> 00:05:50.730
You can't do anything with that monster!

00:05:50.730 --> 00:05:55.370
Due to the effect of Abyss Kid in my 
graveyard, I destroy Abyss Guardian on my field!

00:05:55.370 --> 00:06:00.010
The Battle Phase ends, and you 
take 800 points of damage!

00:06:00.310 --> 00:06:02.300
I activate Extra Veiler's effect!

00:06:03.530 --> 00:06:07.870
You take the effect damage that 
I would've taken this turn!

00:06:07.870 --> 00:06:08.720
What?

00:06:13.010 --> 00:06:15.990
I set one card and end my turn!

00:06:16.730 --> 00:06:21.160
When Red Dragon Archfiend is 
faceup during the End Phase,

00:06:21.510 --> 00:06:24.620
Extra Veiler is destroyed 
because it didn't attack.

00:06:29.040 --> 00:06:33.120
Jack used strategy for the first time 
during this duel to avoid an attack.

00:06:33.120 --> 00:06:35.440
Furthermore, he dealt damage.

00:06:35.720 --> 00:06:38.040
He changed his battle technique.

00:06:39.590 --> 00:06:41.310
Oh my.

00:06:41.310 --> 00:06:43.610
I know how it feels to hold on to an ideal.

00:06:43.610 --> 00:06:47.360
After talking on and on about 
your ideals, that wasn't cool.

00:06:47.540 --> 00:06:51.760
My master Crimson Devil is also angry!

00:06:53.580 --> 00:06:55.070
Jack Atlas.

00:06:55.340 --> 00:07:01.030
No matter how you battle, you can't 
defeat the Crimson Devil's familar!

00:07:01.350 --> 00:07:06.640
You should duel in your usual manner 
and let Crimson Devil take you.

00:07:07.000 --> 00:07:07.960
Stop messing around!

00:07:08.260 --> 00:07:11.440
Tell your master that things 
won't go as planned!

00:07:13.240 --> 00:07:14.570
You asked for it.

00:07:20.680 --> 00:07:21.440
Jack!

00:07:27.060 --> 00:07:34.770
If you die during the duel, you'll still lose the 
match, and your body will belong to Crimson Devil.

00:07:34.940 --> 00:07:36.860
Please be careful.

00:07:39.860 --> 00:07:40.930
Jack!

00:07:40.930 --> 00:07:42.590
I'm fine, Yusei!

00:07:43.330 --> 00:07:45.420
I'll save you!

00:07:45.600 --> 00:07:48.280
I won't die here!

00:07:48.280 --> 00:07:49.080
Jack!

00:07:51.180 --> 00:07:52.350
Jack…

00:07:54.490 --> 00:07:55.330
I won't lose!

00:07:56.580 --> 00:08:02.840
As long as my rugged soul is still alive, 
I'll do whatever it takes to keep fighting!

00:08:03.320 --> 00:08:05.710
Until my soul burns out!

00:08:05.960 --> 00:08:06.830
Jack…

00:08:07.100 --> 00:08:11.570
Rugged soul…  Burning 
Soul…  That's right.

00:08:11.570 --> 00:08:15.340
Crimson Dragon didn't defeat 
Crimson Devil on its own.

00:08:15.570 --> 00:08:19.180
There was a legendary Signer 
that had Burning Soul.

00:08:20.060 --> 00:08:21.610
A legendary Signer?

00:08:22.940 --> 00:08:26.080
10,000 years ago, during the 
battle between Crimson Dragon

00:08:26.080 --> 00:08:28.240
and the evil god that 
occurs every 5000 years...

00:08:28.460 --> 00:08:35.010
...Crimson Devil Red Nova, the strongest Earthbound 
Immortal, pushed Crimson Dragon to the edge of defeat.

00:08:36.520 --> 00:08:41.890
That's when the ancestor of the Signers 
emerged from the flames of a volcano.

00:08:42.800 --> 00:08:44.650
Burning Soul.

00:08:44.920 --> 00:08:50.380
When the rugged soul penetrated 
his body, a miracle occurred!

00:09:01.690 --> 00:09:06.710
He gained the Crimson Dragon's power, and 
he defeated and sealed away Crimson Devil.

00:09:11.560 --> 00:09:15.350
He had the rugged soul known as Burning Soul!

00:09:21.350 --> 00:09:24.700
Rugged soul…  Burning Soul…

00:09:25.050 --> 00:09:27.100
Bring it, Crimson Devil!

00:09:41.170 --> 00:09:43.290
Bring it, Crimson Devil!

00:09:45.260 --> 00:09:48.670
I like your spirit!

00:09:48.670 --> 00:09:53.280
But you're not good enough 
to be Crimson Devil's enemy.

00:09:53.790 --> 00:09:55.270
My turn!

00:09:55.270 --> 00:09:58.680
I set one card and end my turn.

00:09:59.380 --> 00:10:01.180
My turn!

00:10:01.550 --> 00:10:04.140
I flip over my trap card Battle Mania!

00:10:04.370 --> 00:10:09.900
All your monsters switch to attack 
position, and they must attack this turn.

00:10:10.310 --> 00:10:16.350
He's forcing Red Dragon Archfiend to attack 
so that the Abyss combo will activate again.

00:10:17.830 --> 00:10:20.350
I summon Synchro Soldier!

00:10:23.630 --> 00:10:26.070
I activate Synchro Soldier's effect!

00:10:26.070 --> 00:10:30.180
By removing one Synchro Monster from 
play, you take 600 points of damage!

00:10:30.580 --> 00:10:33.060
I remove Red Dragon Archfiend from play!

00:10:37.080 --> 00:10:41.180
Listen to the roar of Red 
Dragon Archfiend's soul!

00:10:48.000 --> 00:10:51.960
When this effect is used, the 
Battle Phase is skipped that turn.

00:10:51.960 --> 00:10:56.920
And the monster that was removed from play 
returns during my next turn's Standby Phase.

00:10:57.200 --> 00:11:00.410
How dare you!

00:11:00.550 --> 00:11:05.410
Jack has clearly changed strategies 
and isn't relying with power.

00:11:05.410 --> 00:11:09.280
Jack is going to battle 
using various strategies.

00:11:10.410 --> 00:11:13.580
That's right.  There must 
be something beyond.

00:11:14.450 --> 00:11:17.640
My new fighting soul awaits!

00:11:18.000 --> 00:11:21.260
I flip over my trap card 
Nightmare Archfiends!

00:11:21.420 --> 00:11:24.260
By releasing Synchro Soldier on my field,

00:11:24.260 --> 00:11:29.710
three Nightmare Archfiend Tokens are 
summoned to your field in attack position!

00:11:29.990 --> 00:11:36.440
For each Nightmare Archfiend Token that's 
destroyed, the controller takes 800 points of damage!

00:11:36.860 --> 00:11:40.680
Oh no!  Abyss Kid is in my graveyard.

00:11:40.860 --> 00:11:42.310
That's right.

00:11:42.310 --> 00:11:46.650
When Abyss Kid is in your graveyard, all 
monsters on your field are destroyed!

00:11:52.350 --> 00:11:55.560
The enemy is down to 200 life points.

00:11:55.840 --> 00:11:58.090
He outsmarted the Abyss combo!

00:11:58.090 --> 00:12:02.520
By not relying on power, Jack's 
new strategy is paying off!

00:12:03.000 --> 00:12:03.970
Jack!

00:12:07.340 --> 00:12:11.830
I won't let you oppose 
Crimson Devil any further!

00:12:12.050 --> 00:12:16.050
Anger turns into flames and devours you!

00:12:20.410 --> 00:12:22.230
My turn!

00:12:22.820 --> 00:12:28.350
I remove Abyss Kid, Abyss Boat Watchman and 
Abyss Guardian in my graveyard from play.

00:12:30.010 --> 00:12:34.450
I Special Summon Abyss Ruler Mictlancoatl!

00:12:35.830 --> 00:12:38.910
Crimson Devil is angry!

00:12:39.340 --> 00:12:42.750
He's angry!

00:12:49.830 --> 00:12:50.580
Jack!

00:12:50.940 --> 00:12:53.290
Bommer, look at that!

00:12:57.920 --> 00:13:01.790
Crimson Devil is about to resurrect!

00:13:01.950 --> 00:13:06.660
Abyss Ruler Mictlancoatl 
attacks Jack directly!

00:13:07.120 --> 00:13:08.770
Hundred Demon Serpent Bite!

00:13:08.940 --> 00:13:10.340
I flip over my trap card!

00:13:10.760 --> 00:13:12.170
Red Screen!

00:13:12.440 --> 00:13:16.140
Monsters with 2000-or-more 
attack points can't attack!

00:13:16.390 --> 00:13:20.480
In that case, I activate Abyss 
Ruler Mictlancoatl's effect!

00:13:20.630 --> 00:13:27.480
Once a turn, one faceup card on your field 
is destroyed, and you take 600 points of damage!

00:13:28.350 --> 00:13:31.480
I destroy Red Screen!

00:13:33.120 --> 00:13:34.930
Their life points are equal!

00:13:34.930 --> 00:13:39.390
From my hand, I activate the 
Continuous Spell Magic Law!

00:13:40.230 --> 00:13:44.470
By sending three monster cards with the 
same name in my hand to the graveyard...

00:13:44.470 --> 00:13:49.770
...you can't use spell cards until 
the End Phase of my next turn, Jack.

00:13:53.040 --> 00:13:56.430
I send three cards with the 
same name to the graveyard.

00:13:57.860 --> 00:14:00.920
Those cards were in Max's deck!

00:14:00.920 --> 00:14:03.150
This is all a trap by the evil god!

00:14:03.150 --> 00:14:05.050
I end my turn!

00:14:08.090 --> 00:14:11.890
The contractual ritual is 
nearing the final chapter!

00:14:16.180 --> 00:14:21.650
It's now time for my master 
Crimson Devil to resurrect!

00:14:26.650 --> 00:14:30.850
That's Red Nova, the Crimson Devil!

00:14:30.850 --> 00:14:37.990
Jack Atlas, my master says that you have no 
cards in your hand or deck that can defeat me!

00:14:48.750 --> 00:14:50.920
Yusei!  Bommer!  Max!

00:14:55.810 --> 00:15:02.220
They will be ritually sacrificed, and the 
sound of their agonizing death will be the climax!

00:15:02.220 --> 00:15:04.220
I won't let you do that!

00:15:04.220 --> 00:15:09.310
My irreplaceable friends support me!

00:15:10.050 --> 00:15:15.300
Even if my body and soul burn 
out, I will protect them!

00:15:15.530 --> 00:15:16.520
Jack…

00:15:16.770 --> 00:15:19.630
What are you talking about?  
The battle is over!

00:15:19.630 --> 00:15:26.170
Their sacrifices and your body 
belong to my master Crimson Devil!

00:15:27.110 --> 00:15:30.240
My soul won't let that happen!

00:15:31.140 --> 00:15:36.180
You forgot that my soul is coming back!

00:15:37.630 --> 00:15:42.090
Red Dragon Archfiend resurrects 
during his Standby Phase.

00:15:42.090 --> 00:15:46.090
Red Dragon Archfiend lights my soul!

00:15:47.060 --> 00:15:51.800
Red Dragon Archfiend won't be 
able to resist Crimson Devil!

00:15:51.800 --> 00:15:55.330
I can feel the pulse of my soul!

00:15:56.370 --> 00:15:57.470
That's…

00:15:57.470 --> 00:16:00.270
My rugged soul!

00:16:01.970 --> 00:16:03.210
Burning Soul!

00:16:03.210 --> 00:16:06.620
Jack has the power of the legendary man.

00:16:06.790 --> 00:16:09.250
My turn!

00:16:10.470 --> 00:16:13.360
I won't let you!

00:16:18.930 --> 00:16:19.900
Jack!

00:16:31.080 --> 00:16:32.090
This is…

00:16:38.970 --> 00:16:40.080
Crimson Dragon!

00:16:40.080 --> 00:16:41.900
Quetzalcoatl!

00:16:42.370 --> 00:16:47.050
In this land, we worship the 
guardian god Quetzalcoatl.

00:16:55.690 --> 00:17:02.420
Red Dragon Archfiend that was removed from play by 
Synchro Soldier resurrects during this Standby Phase!

00:17:03.820 --> 00:17:10.380
When a Synchro Monster is on my field, I can 
Special Summon the Tuner Monster Creation Resonator!

00:17:15.300 --> 00:17:19.090
Next, I summon the Tuner 
Monster Attack Gainer!

00:17:21.330 --> 00:17:27.790
Tuner Monsters Level 1 Attack Gainer 
and Level 3 Creation Resonator

00:17:27.790 --> 00:17:31.230
double tune Level 8 Red Dragon Archfiend!

00:17:31.230 --> 00:17:33.230
Two Tuner Monsters?

00:17:33.230 --> 00:17:34.830
You're allowed to Synchro like that?

00:17:42.510 --> 00:17:47.410
Wow!  How could he get a 
Level 12 Synchro Monster?

00:17:47.680 --> 00:17:53.270
The person with Burning Soul gains the 
Crimson Dragon's power and creates miracles.

00:17:54.690 --> 00:17:56.450
My rugged soul!

00:17:56.450 --> 00:18:00.530
I'll use its power to 
seal Crimson Devil again!

00:18:03.020 --> 00:18:05.370
What's going on?

00:18:07.390 --> 00:18:09.930
No way!

00:18:09.930 --> 00:18:14.270
Crimson Devil, I'll take all your power!

00:18:14.390 --> 00:18:18.730
The king and devil now 
merge here!  Rugged soul!

00:18:18.730 --> 00:18:21.200
Give the roar that created heaven and earth!

00:18:21.200 --> 00:18:22.680
Synchro Summon!

00:18:23.050 --> 00:18:26.140
Come, Red Nova Dragon!

00:18:40.960 --> 00:18:46.270
Impossible…  You subdued 
my master Crimson Devil.

00:18:46.270 --> 00:18:48.740
Jack is incredible!

00:18:48.900 --> 00:18:51.740
I activate Red Nova Dragon's effect!

00:18:51.740 --> 00:18:56.450
For every Tuner Monster in my graveyard, 
it gains 500 attack points!

00:18:56.830 --> 00:18:59.320
There are four Tuner 
Monsters in my graveyard!

00:18:59.320 --> 00:19:05.540
Therefore, Red Nova Dragon gains 
2000 attack points, making it 5500!

00:19:06.260 --> 00:19:07.660
No way…

00:19:07.660 --> 00:19:10.090
How dare you do that when I have no master!

00:19:10.260 --> 00:19:12.100
I'll show you my power!

00:19:12.100 --> 00:19:16.100
I used various strategies 
to gain ultimate power!

00:19:16.100 --> 00:19:19.500
This is my soul for my new battle technique!

00:19:19.500 --> 00:19:23.910
Red Nova Dragon attacks 
Abyss Ruler Mictlancoatl!

00:19:24.590 --> 00:19:26.350
Burning Soul!

00:20:19.730 --> 00:20:20.960
Crimson Dragon…

00:20:24.640 --> 00:20:26.130
Quetzalcoatl.

00:20:36.240 --> 00:20:39.720
Yusei and Jack, please come again.

00:20:39.720 --> 00:20:40.250
Yeah.

00:20:40.450 --> 00:20:41.920
You must be kidding!

00:20:42.510 --> 00:20:44.820
I've had enough with the occult!

00:20:46.130 --> 00:20:47.160
Jack!

00:20:47.160 --> 00:20:51.020
I'll keep believing in my deck!

00:20:51.180 --> 00:20:55.770
As long as I believe, I can someday 
create a deck that rivals the King's!

00:20:56.030 --> 00:20:58.460
Yeah, I'm looking forward to it!

00:20:58.460 --> 00:21:01.650
Someday, we'll battle 
using your trusted deck.

00:21:02.460 --> 00:21:04.610
I'll come here just for that!

00:21:11.210 --> 00:21:12.130
Jack.

00:21:12.850 --> 00:21:17.080
Crimson Dragon may be the one 
who brought you to this land.

00:21:17.790 --> 00:21:24.330
You think I used Crimson Devil 
to acquire Burning Soul?

00:21:27.700 --> 00:21:28.970
Clear Mind and…

00:21:28.970 --> 00:21:30.340
…Burning Soul.

00:21:30.710 --> 00:21:35.770
With these two new powers, we 
must defeat Iliaster's threat!

00:21:50.490 --> 00:21:55.860
Close to you  Keep what's 
precious in your heart

00:21:56.330 --> 00:22:02.570
There's only one shining 
soul that's next to you

00:22:15.550 --> 00:22:20.850
You always pretend and hide your fears

00:22:21.190 --> 00:22:26.490
You act tough and don't listen to anyone

00:22:26.790 --> 00:22:32.100
You do this over and over

00:22:32.460 --> 00:22:37.840
I shouted until my soul would break

00:22:38.100 --> 00:22:43.240
Hurry up and throw that away

00:22:43.780 --> 00:22:50.750
We're only heading towards tomorrow

00:22:51.180 --> 00:22:56.490
Close to you  If you're 
trying to find yourself

00:22:56.890 --> 00:23:02.330
Just keep doing what you ultimately decided

00:23:02.490 --> 00:23:07.800
Close to you  Keep what's 
precious in your heart

00:23:08.300 --> 00:23:15.910
There's only one shining 
soul that's next to you
